{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13208170","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13208170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1320817001:1":{"text":"하하, 친구. 요즘 눈보라가 심해서 야수가 동굴에 들어와 쉬는 경우가 있더군!","source_cn":"嚯嚯，朋友，最近风雪很大，会有野兽来洞内取暖歇息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA3035BD3FC804D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320817002:1":{"text":"집에 돌아갈 때 조심해. 다음 교대 조는 안전을 위해 채굴하러 올 때 무기를 준비하라고 해.","source_cn":"你回家时注意些，让之后换班来采集的人配好武器，保障安全。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F0BDE423587CD6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320817003:1":{"text":"뭐? 그것 때문에 돌아온 거야?","source_cn":"什么？你们是特意赶回来的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CCE774611F6561F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320817004:1":{"text":"나도 오늘은 이만 돌아갈 거야. 채굴한 광석을 제련소로 보내고 나면 집에 가야지.","source_cn":"我也准备收工了，等把开凿出来的矿石运到冶炼处，我就回家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22B02F908443E2D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320817005:1":{"text":"잘 가라고, 친구들!","source_cn":"再见，朋友们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2834D5BF973F7985","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320817006:1":{"text":"우리 동료들은 마지막까지 자리를 지키는 성실함을 가지고 있다니까.","source_cn":"我的同胞如此认真负责，坚守到最后一刻。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E217825E1D22D06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320817007:1":{"text":"좋아, 조각상 제작 과정을 보고 싶다고 했지? 한쪽이 얼음을 쪼개는 동안 다른 쪽은 얼음 조각상을 지탱할 금속 골조를 제작하지. 제련부터 모양을 잡는 것까지, 모든 과정을 우리 동료들이 맡고 있어.","source_cn":"好了，你们之前说想参观雕像制作的全流程。一队工匠开凿冰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A6215FAF62B4433","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320817008:1":{"text":"...따라와! 우리도 <style=\"highlight\">시더 마을</style>로 돌아갈 때가 되었군!","source_cn":"——跟我来，我们也该回<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5769A4C6CF6368CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:呼金":{"text":"후긴","source":"呼金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:大嗓门矿工":{"text":"목소리 큰 광부","source":"大嗓门矿工","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}